<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title><![CDATA[Spring]]></title><description><![CDATA[Level up your Java code and explore what Spring can do for you.]]></description><link>https://spring.io</link><generator>GatsbyJS</generator><lastBuildDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:38:00 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title><![CDATA[Spring Security 2025-11 Releases - 7.0.0, 6.5.7, 6.4.13 available now!]]></title><link>https://spring.io/blog/2025/11/17/spring-security-releases</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://spring.io/blog/2025/11/17/spring-security-releases</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[rwinch]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Mon, 17 Nov 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;On behalf of the team and everyone who has contributed, I am pleased to announce the availability of Spring Security &lt;code&gt;7.0.0&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;6.5.7&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;6.4.13&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
